## 第二步：锁头核心（角度计算 + 平滑 + 后坐力补偿）

拿到骨骼世界坐标后，这一层是通用的，跟游戏无关：

```cpp
#include <cmath>

struct Vec3 { float x, y, z; };

// 世界坐标 -> 相机空间角度（UE4/UE5 系常用：yaw/pitch，Z 向上）
// cameraPos: 相机世界坐标, targetPos: 目标骨骼世界坐标
void CalcAngle(const Vec3& cameraPos, const Vec3& targetPos,
               float& outYaw, float& outPitch) {
    Vec3 d{ targetPos.x - cameraPos.x,
            targetPos.y - cameraPos.y,
            targetPos.z - cameraPos.z };
    float hyp = std::sqrt(d.x*d.x + d.y*d.y);
    outYaw   = std::atan2(d.y, d.x) * (180.0f / 3.14159265f);
    outPitch = std::atan2(d.z, hyp) * (180.0f / 3.14159265f);
}

// 平滑拟人化：把当前视角插值到目标角度，避免瞬移式抖枪
// smooth: 1=瞬锁 越大越慢
float NormalizeAngleDelta(float from, float to) {
    float d = std::remainder(to - from, 360.0f);
    return d;
}

void SmoothAim(float& curYaw, float& curPitch,
               float tgtYaw, float tgtPitch,
               float smooth) {
    curYaw   += NormalizeAngleDelta(curYaw,   tgtYaw)   / smooth;
    curPitch += NormalizeAngleDelta(curPitch, tgtPitch) / smooth;
    if (curPitch >  89.0f) curPitch =  89.0f;
    if (curPitch < -89.0f) curPitch = -89.0f;
}
```

